# Project

Read and follow `AGENTS.md`. Do not duplicate it here.

After PHP changes run `composer run phpcs`, `composer run phpstan`, and `composer run test`. Run `vendor/bin/phpcbf` first for formatting.

Never edit `vendor/`. Don't hand-edit `composer.lock`.
